WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
If only I could come across a store in these two days

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,800
Or just let the monster hurt people.

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,420
Maybe we can use new subordinates

4
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,620
You bought and repaired weapons, right?

5
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,220
The Little Prince of Taiwan is not talking about my delicious food

6
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,620
Can you attract monsters to hurt people?

7
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,020
Waiting for leaving the copy room

8
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:44,020
Those monsters are so scary

9
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,620
A truck can't hit it

10
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:47,620
If I hadn't had a vehicle repair card

11
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:49,620
I'm afraid I'll die on the road.

12
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,020
Have you killed monsters?

13
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,020
Also kill monsters

14
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,620
It's not enough to blame them for killing us.

15
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:55,620
Able to escape all the way to the finish line and save one's life

16
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:58,020
Just be obsessed with Buddha, right?

17
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,020
The copy is so difficult

18
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:00,420
Life is not easy

19
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:01,820
Person No. 20

20
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,820
Could it be that only eleven of us survived?

21
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:11,200
The vehicle is in such tatters

22
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,550
He probably had a narrow escape from death.

23
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:15,350
I'm the first to reach the finish line

24
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:16,750
First place reward

25
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:17,750
I'm determined
